{%- liquid
  assign is_fr = false
  if request.locale.iso_code contains 'fr'
    assign is_fr = true
  endif
  assign free_shipping_cents = 12500
  assign subtotal_cents = cart.items_subtotal_price
  assign shipping_remaining_cents = free_shipping_cents | minus: subtotal_cents
  if shipping_remaining_cents < 0
    assign shipping_remaining_cents = 0
  endif

  assign cross_sell_handles = 'antared-desk-red-light-therapy-panel,cap,mask,antared-sauna-dome-infrared-red-light-pemf,pano-plus,antared-pano-ultra' | split: ','
  assign cross_sell_shown = 0

  # Reductions.
  #
  # Shopify range les remises dans DEUX endroits distincts, et le recapitulatif
  # n'en lisait qu'un. `cart.cart_level_discount_applications` ne porte que les
  # remises de commande ; une remise produit ou une remise automatique posee par
  # une Shopify Function s'alloue ligne par ligne, dans
  # `item.line_level_discount_allocations`. Comme `cart.items_subtotal_price`
  # est deja net de ces allocations, le sous-total baissait tout seul sans
  # qu'aucune ligne ne dise pourquoi : la remise etait invisible dans le panier
  # et ne reapparaissait qu'au paiement.
  #
  # Le sous-total affiche est donc `cart.original_total_price` (avant toute
  # remise), suivi d'une ligne par remise. L'arithmetique se referme :
  #   original_total_price - remises de ligne = items_subtotal_price
  #   items_subtotal_price - remises de commande = total_price
  #
  # Les allocations de ligne sont regroupees par intitule : une remise
  # automatique qui touche trois articles est une seule remise, pas trois.
  # Faute de tableaux d'objets en Liquid, la liste des intitules deja vus
  # passe par une chaine a separateur — le meme procede que les pages
  # Protocoles. Aucun nom de remise ne contient '||~||'.
  assign line_discount_titles = ''
  for item in cart.items
    for allocation in item.line_level_discount_allocations
      assign discount_title = allocation.discount_application.title
      assign seen = line_discount_titles | split: '||~||'
      unless seen contains discount_title
        assign line_discount_titles = line_discount_titles | append: discount_title | append: '||~||'
      endunless
    endfor
  endfor
  assign line_discount_titles = line_discount_titles | split: '||~||'
-%}
<section class="container">
  {% if cart.item_count > 0 %}
    <div class="cart">
      <div class="cart__main">
        <form action="{{ routes.cart_url }}" method="post" novalidate class="cart__form">
          <h1>{% if is_fr %}Votre panier{% else %}Your cart{% endif %}</h1>

          <p class="cart-shipping-note{% if shipping_remaining_cents == 0 %} cart-shipping-note--done{% endif %}" aria-live="polite">
            {%- if shipping_remaining_cents > 0 -%}
              {% if is_fr %}Livraison offerte d&egrave;s 125 &euro;{% else %}Free shipping on orders over &euro;125{% endif %}
            {%- else -%}
              &#10003; {% if is_fr %}Livraison offerte{% else %}Free shipping{% endif %}
            {%- endif -%}
          </p>

          <div class="cart__items">
            {% for item in cart.items %}
              <div class="cart-item" data-line="{{ forloop.index }}">
                <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="cart-item__img">
                  {% if item.image != blank %}
                    <img src="{{ item.image | image_url: width: 240 }}" alt="{{ item.title | escape }}" width="120" height="120" loading="lazy">
                  {% endif %}
                </a>
                <div>
                  <a href="{{ item.url }}" class="cart-item__title">{{ item.product.title }}</a>
                  {% unless item.product.has_only_default_variant %}
                    <div class="cart-item__variant">{{ item.variant.title }}</div>
                  {% endunless %}
                  {%- if item.line_level_discount_allocations.size > 0 -%}
                    <ul class="cart-item__discounts">
                      {%- for allocation in item.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
                        <li>{{ allocation.discount_application.title }} &middot; &minus;{{ allocation.amount | money }}</li>
                      {%- endfor -%}
                    </ul>
                  {%- endif -%}
                  <div class="product__qty" style="margin-top:10px;">
                    <button type="button" data-qty-step="-1">&minus;</button>
                    <input type="number" name="updates[]" value="{{ item.quantity }}" min="0" data-line-key="{{ item.key }}">
                    <button type="button" data-qty-step="1">+</button>
                  </div>
                  <a href="{{ item.url_to_remove }}" data-cart-remove data-line-key="{{ item.key }}" style="font-size:.8rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin-top:8px; display:inline-block;">{% if is_fr %}Retirer{% else %}Remove{% endif %}</a>
                </div>
                <div class="cart-item__price">
                  {%- if item.original_line_price > item.final_line_price -%}
                    <s class="cart-item__price-was">{{ item.original_line_price | money }}</s>
                    <span class="cart-item__price-now">{{ item.final_line_price | money }}</span>
                  {%- else -%}
                    {{ item.final_line_price | money }}
                  {%- endif -%}
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
          {%- comment -%}
            Bouton de repli, jamais affiche : chaque changement de quantite part
            en direct via `/cart/change.js` (theme.js). Sans JavaScript, ou si
            la requete echoue, c'est ce bouton qui sert de soumission implicite
            au formulaire — d'ou le `tabindex="-1"` plutot qu'un `hidden`, qui
            l'aurait retire de la soumission implicite dans certains navigateurs.
          {%- endcomment -%}
          <button type="submit" name="update" class="visually-hidden" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">{% if is_fr %}Mettre &agrave; jour le panier{% else %}Update cart{% endif %}</button>
        </form>

        <div class="cart-crosssell">
          <h2>{% if is_fr %}Compl&eacute;tez votre rituel{% else %}Complete your ritual{% endif %}</h2>
          <div class="cart-crosssell__grid">
            {% for handle in cross_sell_handles %}
              {% assign cs_product = all_products[handle] %}
              {% if cs_product == blank or cs_product.available == false %}
                {% continue %}
              {% endif %}
              {% assign in_cart = false %}
              {% for item in cart.items %}
                {% if item.product_id == cs_product.id %}
                  {% assign in_cart = true %}
                {% endif %}
              {% endfor %}
              {% if in_cart %}
                {% continue %}
              {% endif %}
              {% if cross_sell_shown >= 3 %}
                {% break %}
              {% endif %}
              {% assign cross_sell_shown = cross_sell_shown | plus: 1 %}
              {%- comment -%}
                Nom court plutot que le titre complet de la fiche : sur une
                carte de cette largeur, l'intitule long ("Antared DESK - 7-
                Spectrum Red Light Therapy Panel") s'enroulait sur quatre
                lignes et le bouton ADD atterrissait a une hauteur differente
                d'une carte a l'autre. Meme procede que `main-product.liquid`
                pour deriver un contenu depuis le handle.
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {%- assign cs_short_title = cs_product.title -%}
              {%- case handle -%}
                {%- when 'antared-desk-red-light-therapy-panel' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Desk' -%}
                {%- when 'cap' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Cap' -%}
                {%- when 'mask' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Mask' -%}
                {%- when 'cytolight-foot' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Foot' -%}
                {%- when 'cytolight-knee' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Knee' -%}
                {%- when 'cytolight-pano-ultra' -%}{%- assign cs_short_title = 'Antared Pano Ultra' -%}
              {%- endcase -%}
              <div class="cart-crosssell-card">
                <a href="{{ cs_product.url }}" class="cart-crosssell-card__img">
                  {% if cs_product.featured_image != blank %}
                    <img src="{{ cs_product.featured_image | image_url: width: 400 }}" alt="{{ cs_product.featured_image.alt | escape }}" width="400" height="400" loading="lazy">
                  {% endif %}
                </a>
                <div class="cart-crosssell-card__body">
                  <a href="{{ cs_product.url }}" class="cart-crosssell-card__title" title="{{ cs_product.title | escape }}">{{ cs_short_title }}</a>
                  <p class="cart-crosssell-card__price">{{ cs_product.price | money }}</p>
                  {% form 'product', cs_product %}
                    <input type="hidden" name="id" value="{{ cs_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.id }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="quantity" value="1">
                    <input type="hidden" name="return_to" value="{{ routes.cart_url }}">
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn--ghost btn--sm" {% unless cs_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}disabled{% endunless %}>
                      {% if cs_product.selected_or_first_available_variant.available %}{% if is_fr %}Ajouter{% else %}Add{% endif %}{% else %}{% if is_fr %}&Eacute;puis&eacute;{% else %}Sold out{% endif %}{% endif %}
                    </button>
                  {% endform %}
                </div>
              </div>
            {% endfor %}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="cart-summary">
        <div class="cart-summary__row"><span>{% if is_fr %}Sous-total{% else %}Subtotal{% endif %}</span><span>{{ cart.original_total_price | money }}</span></div>
        {%- for discount_title in line_discount_titles -%}
          {%- assign discount_amount = 0 -%}
          {%- for item in cart.items -%}
            {%- for allocation in item.line_level_discount_allocations -%}
              {%- if allocation.discount_application.title == discount_title -%}
                {%- assign discount_amount = discount_amount | plus: allocation.amount -%}
              {%- endif -%}
            {%- endfor -%}
          {%- endfor -%}
          <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--discount"><span>{{ discount_title }}</span><span>&minus;{{ discount_amount | money }}</span></div>
        {%- endfor -%}
        {% for discount in cart.cart_level_discount_applications %}
          <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__row--discount"><span>{{ discount.title }}</span><span>&minus;{{ discount.total_allocated_amount | money }}</span></div>
        {% endfor %}
        {%- assign total_saved = cart.original_total_price | minus: cart.total_price -%}
        <div class="cart-summary__row cart-summary__total"><span>Total</span><span>{{ cart.total_price | money }}</span></div>
        {%- if total_saved > 0 -%}
          <p class="cart-summary__saved">{% if is_fr %}Vous &eacute;conomisez {{ total_saved | money }}{% else %}You save {{ total_saved | money }}{% endif %}</p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p style="font-size:.8rem; color: var(--color-muted); margin: 8px 0 0;">{% if is_fr %}Taxes et livraison calcul&eacute;es au paiement.{% else %}Taxes and shipping calculated at checkout.{% endif %}</p>
        <a href="{{ routes.cart_url }}/checkout" class="btn btn--primary">{% if is_fr %}Paiement{% else %}Checkout{% endif %} &rarr;</a>
        <p style="text-align:center; margin: 12px 0 0; font-size:.8rem;"><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">{% if is_fr %}Continuer mes achats{% else %}Continue shopping{% endif %}</a></p>
        <div class="cart-trust">
          <span>&#10003; {% if is_fr %}Essai satisfait ou rembours&eacute; de 14 jours{% else %}14-day money-back trial{% endif %}</span>
          <span>&#10003; {% if is_fr %}Garantie 2 ans{% else %}2-year warranty{% endif %}</span>
          <span>&#10003; {% if is_fr %}Paiement s&eacute;curis&eacute;{% else %}Secure checkout{% endif %}</span>
        </div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  {% else %}
    <div class="cart-empty">
      <h1>{% if is_fr %}Votre panier est vide{% else %}Your cart is empty{% endif %}</h1>
      <p style="color: var(--color-muted);">{% if is_fr %}D&eacute;couvrez nos meilleures ventes et commencez votre rituel bien-&ecirc;tre.{% else %}Discover our best sellers and start your wellness ritual.{% endif %}</p>
      <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}" class="btn btn--primary" style="margin-top:16px;">{% if is_fr %}Voir les meilleures ventes{% else %}Shop best sellers{% endif %} &rarr;</a>

      <div class="cart-crosssell cart-crosssell--empty">
        <h2>{% if is_fr %}Nos rituels les plus populaires{% else %}Our most popular rituals{% endif %}</h2>
        <div class="collection-grid">
          {% for handle in cross_sell_handles %}
            {% assign cs_product = all_products[handle] %}
            {% if cs_product == blank or cs_product.available == false %}
              {% continue %}
            {% endif %}
            {% if cross_sell_shown >= 4 %}
              {% break %}
            {% endif %}
            {% assign cross_sell_shown = cross_sell_shown | plus: 1 %}
            {% render 'product-card', product: cs_product %}
          {% endfor %}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  {% endif %}
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Cart",
  "tag": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
